Z||000001||JBGehling||03-08-2001||09:04 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTCool.jpg"> <P>Next, we have my 88 Formula. It has 28,000 miles on it and is in perfect condition inside and out!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FormulaFront.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FormulaSide.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FormulaBack.jpg"> ||||reg||1
